i><li>If clarification or additional documents are needed, we will contact you accordingly.</li></ul></p><div class="v-text-align v-line-height" style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 140%; text-align: left; word-wrap: break-word;"><p style="line-height: 140%; text-align: left;"><strong><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: #ed1c24; line-height: 22.4px;">Important Note :<br></span></strong></p></div><p style="line-height: 110%;">Kindly note that the transaction is currently on hold. If we do not receive a response from you, we might need to reject the transaction.</p><p style="line-height: 110%;"><br>Please, click <a target="_blank" href="https://www.rakbank.ae/en/help-centre/service-price-guides" rel="noopener">here</a> to view Services & Price Guide related to your product.</p><p style="line-height: 110%; text-align: left;"><span style="font-size: 14px; font-family: calibri; color: black; line-height: 15.4px;"><span style="color: black; background: white; line-height: 15.4px;">Your banking partner,</span><span style="color: #333333; line-height: 15.4px;"><br></span><strong><span style="color: #ed1c24; background: white; line-height: 15.4px;">Trade Customer Service</span></strong></span></p><div class="v-text-align v-line-height" style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 140%; text-align: left; word-wrap: break-word;"><p style="line-height: 140%; text-align: left;"><strong><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: #ed1c24; line-height: 22.4px;"><strong>RAKBANK</span></strong></p></div></tbody></body></html></MailMessage>
