<NoOfTrials>0</NoOfTrials><ZipFlag>N</ZipFlag><MaxZipSize>0</MaxZipSize><ContentType>text/html;charset=UTF-8</ContentType><Priority>1</Priority><InsertedTime>2025-12-26 12:04:12.153</InsertedTime><LastLockTime>2025-12-26 12:21:24.383</LastLockTime><InsertedBy>6624A6B4:14C64631955:-7FFF/ANT1OMNIAPPS01/cas</InsertedBy><MailActionType>TRIGGER</MailActionType><ProcessDefId>36</ProcessDefId><ProcessInstanceId>TF-0001037590-Process</ProcessInstanceId></MailItem><WorkitemId>3</WorkitemId><ActivityId>21</ActivityId><CSSession>0</CSSession><MailSubject>Transaction Reference Number – Needs Attention</MailSubject><MailMessage><html><tbody><p style="line-height: 110%;">Hello,</p><p style="line-height: 110%;">We’re reaching out to you regarding your pending transaction with the below details:<br><br>Customer Name: <strong>JSPANICK</strong><br>Product Type: <strong>STLI ISS - Short Term Loan Against Invoice - Issuance</strong><br>Currency: <strong>AED</strong><br>Amount: <strong>10000000.000</strong><br><br>Our team has reviewed the transaction and noticed a few points that require clarification or additional input before we can proceed:<br><br><strong>get all</strong> <br><br>We request you to share the relevant details or documents within 3 days. You can respond by:<br><li>Replying directly to this email</li><li>Reaching out to your Relationship Manager</li><li>Contacting us at <strong>800 6789</strong> (Monday–Thursday: 8am–5pm, Friday: 8am–3pm)</li></p><div class="v-text-align v-line-height" style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 140%; text-align: left; word-wrap: break-word;"><p style="line-height: 140%; text-align: left;"><strong><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: #ed1c24; line-height: 22.4px;">Next Steps :</span></strong></p></div><p style="line-height: 110%;"><ul style="line-height: 110%; margin: 0; padding-left: 20px;"><li>Once we receive the required information and documents in order, your transaction will be processed within 2 working days.</li><li>If clarification or additional documents are needed, we will contact you accordingly.</li></ul></p><div class="v-text-align v-line-height" style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 140%; text-align: left; word-wrap: break-word;"><p style="line-height: 140%; text-align: left;"><strong><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: #ed1c24; line-height: 22.4px;">Important Note :<br></span></strong></p></div><p style="line-height: 110%;">Kindly note that the transaction is currently on hold. If we do not receive a response from you, we might need to reject the transaction.</p><p style="line-height: 110%;"><br>Please, click <a target="_blank" href="https://www.rakbank.ae/en/help-centre/service-price-guides" rel="noopener">here</a> to view Services & Price Guide related to your product.</p><p style="line-height: 110%; text-align: left;"><span style="font-size: 14px; font-family: calibri; color: black; line-height: 15.4px;"><span style="color: black; background: white; line-height: 15.4px;">Your banking partner,</span><span style="color: #333333; line-height: 15.4px;"><br></span><strong><span style="color: #ed1c24; background: white; line-height: 15.4px;">Trade Customer Service</span></strong></span></p><div class="v-text-align v-line-height" style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 140%; text-align: left; word-wrap: break-word;"><p style="line-height: 140%; text-align: left;"><strong><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: #ed1c24; line-height: 22.4px;"><strong>RAKBANK</span></strong></p></div></tbody></body></html></MailMessage>
